77:  * was deleted since). As for a direct send (useMessages.sendMessage): unless
78:  * the feed already observed the key or this client saw the message deleted,
79:  * merge the stored message into a loaded (or loading) feed first, then drop
80:  * the pending copy — never two bubbles, never none.
